[en.FOCUS_C08_HEALS_SCARS]
Heal the Wounds

[en.FOCUS_C08_HEALS_SCARS_desc]
Slave trade, Gang rule, War... Manehattan has suffered a lot.\n\nWhat she needs is healing, recuperation, and return to the prosperous and shining era.

[zh.FOCUS_C08_HEALS_SCARS]
抚平伤痕

[zh.FOCUS_C08_HEALS_SCARS_desc]
奴隶贸易、黑帮统治、战火硝烟... 马哈顿受尽了磨难。\n\n她需要的是治疗，修养，回到曾经繁华又闪耀的时代。

